{"segs": ["PA_ja_195:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_195:0.2", "PA_ja_195:0.3"], "en": "The Second Book of Pairs (Dukanipāta), Chapter on Ruhaka (Ruhakavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_195:0.4"], "en": "5. The Pabbatūpatthara Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_195:1.1", "PA_ja_195:1.2"], "en": "\"On the delightful mountain slope, a pure lotus pond has been born.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_195:1.3"], "en": "The jackal drank from it,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_195:1.4"], "en": "knowing it was protected by the lion.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_195:2.1"], "en": "\"If they drink, O Great King,\" [they drink].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_195:2.2"], "en": "The great river has its banks;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_195:2.3"], "en": "it does not become a non-river because of that.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_195:2.4"], "en": "If you hold me dear, forgive me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_195:3.1"], "en": "The Fifth Jātaka: The Story of the Mountain-Spread.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
